  "description": "The payment schedule of a non-constant-flow swap contract (the 0301 of section 4.2.7): number of events, the amortization type and one Dados do Fluxo line per event with the event date and the amortization rate of each ponta. Generated by New Deals › Swap › Cashflow together with the 0301 contract record — one file per view (client; Bank and Atacama in the B2B).",
  "file_name_rule": "FLUXO_SWAP_CF_<LOB>_CLIENTE.txt / FLUXO_SWAP_CF_<LOB>_BANCO.txt / FLUXO_SWAP_CF_<LOB>_ATACAMA.txt by view (a `file_name` registered on the variant of the pair wins), written by the Send button into Batch Conecta › New next to the SWAP_CF_<LOB>_*.txt of the same deal.",
  "notes": "Header 38, Registro 62, Dados do Fluxo 194 characters (the manual prints no Tamanho do Registro). Meu Número Operação Reg. Contrato = the Meu Número of the contract record of the same view; Papel = the PONTA of the Parte by the smaller account number (the 0897 criterion — an assumption, the 4.2.8 section does not restate it). P1/P2 dates are the same Payment Date; the amortization rate is the schedule row (blank = 0) on both pontas. The SOFR / TERM SOFR date fields are not generated.",
